1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:04,963
Hello!

5
00:00:05,513 --> 00:00:09,283
Let's go on a safari and meet the wild animals!

6
00:00:10,633 --> 00:00:12,704
Look! It's a lion.

7
00:00:13,204 --> 00:00:14,394
Lion!

8
00:00:14,944 --> 00:00:16,991
What does the lion say?

9
00:00:18,391 --> 00:00:19,258
Roar!

10
00:00:19,808 --> 00:00:22,594
The lion is the king of the jungle.

11
00:00:23,944 --> 00:00:25,658
Who is this?

12
00:00:27,458 --> 00:00:29,394
It's an elephant!

13
00:00:29,944 --> 00:00:32,110
What does the elephant say?

14
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:34,619
Toot, toot!

15
00:00:35,169 --> 00:00:37,717
The elephant has a long trunk.

16
00:00:39,067 --> 00:00:41,138
Look! It's a giraffe.

17
00:00:41,638 --> 00:00:42,747
Giraffe!

18
00:00:43,297 --> 00:00:46,107
The giraffe has a long, long neck.

19
00:00:47,457 --> 00:00:49,623
Look! It's a zebra.

20
00:00:50,123 --> 00:00:51,414
Zebra!

21
00:00:51,964 --> 00:00:54,892
The zebra has black and white stripes.

22
00:00:56,242 --> 00:00:57,956
Who is this?

23
00:00:59,756 --> 00:01:01,531
It's a monkey!

24
00:01:02,081 --> 00:01:04,176
What does the monkey say?

25
00:01:05,576 --> 00:01:07,027
Ooh, ooh, ah, ah!

26
00:01:07,577 --> 00:01:09,982
The monkey loves bananas.

27
00:01:11,332 --> 00:01:14,679
Wow! The wild animals are amazing!

28
00:01:15,229 --> 00:01:17,467
Great job, little learner!

29
00:01:18,017 --> 00:01:19,905
Share Mimzi with a friend,

30
00:01:19,905 --> 00:01:22,445
and subscribe for more learning fun!

31
00:01:22,995 --> 00:01:23,973
Next time,

32
00:01:23,973 --> 00:01:26,080
let's dive under the sea.

33
00:01:26,330 --> 00:01:27,701
Bye bye!
